<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S RAND LEASES SAYS IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S RAND LEASES SAYS IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Rand Leases Properties Ltd said on Friday it was currently in talks which, if successful, could impact its share price.</p>
<p>The firm warned shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in its shares until a further announcement is made. Rand Leases gave no futher details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
